    <string name="chat_verify_banner_body">Your messages are end-to-end encrypted. Confirm that this device really belongs to %1$s so nobody else can read them.</string>
    <string name="chat_verify_action">Verify now</string>
    <string name="chat_verify_why_title">Why verify?</string>
    <string name="chat_verify_why_body">Encryption only protects you if the device receiving your messages is really your contact’s. Comparing one code takes a moment and stops someone from pretending to be them.</string>
    <string name="chat_verify_steps">1. Ask your contact to open their messaging account and read you the code under “This device”.\n2. Compare it with the code below. Every character must match.\n3. If it matches, tap “Trust this device”. If it does not, do not trust it.\nAny message waiting for your approval is sent right after.</string>
